      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-09-03T19:31:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "ptr is not just a generic void* but in the rust case an object implementing the trait AnonInodeFileInterface that in turn implements the various callbacks. So it\u0027s not really optional in this case.",
